Package: coral-usb-hwmon-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Suggests: lm-sensors
Description: Temperature monitoring for the Google Coral USB Accelerator
 Exposes the on-chip sensor via Linux hwmon. An optional apex compatibility
 class supplies the temperature path used by Frigate on USB-only systems.
 DKMS builds the module using the headers for each target kernel.
